      "type": "implementation",
      "status": "PASS",
      "started_at": "2026-07-23T16:09:21Z",
      "completed_at": "2026-07-23T16:17:04Z",
      "duration_ms": 463000,
      "summary": [
        "Migrated all 50+ routes from the ~1,100-line matchRoute() if-else chain into declarative Route entries in buildRoutes(). Deleted matchRoute() entirely. Simplified handleRequest() to a single dispatchRoute() call with 404 fallthrough. Routes organized into Section A (body-parsing, existing), Section B (keyword-specific body-free, both active namespaced and deprecated non-namespaced), Section C (catch-all body-free). JSDoc comment block documents Section B/C ordering constraint as load-bearing. All parameterised routes use RegExp with named capture groups. Query parameters for previously matchRoute-parsed routes (projects list, knowledge list, repos, dialogues, chunks, runs) now received via dispatcher query argument. All 118 test files (3595 tests) pass with no modification."
      ],
